  "body": "One last PR before I go to sleep...\n\n---\n\nThese were never implemented in IE and Opera, and only in quirks mode in Firefox. They were recently removed from Chrome (https://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=277080).\n\nFixes https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=23039.\n\n---\n\nCareful review appreciated to make sure I found everywhere these were relevant.\n\nAlso, I guess Safari still implements this, which is sad. We have a similar situation with showModalDialog.\n",
